OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786744247
OL,3,CFirefighters tackling large wildfire
OL,4,Cnear airport
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a large
OL,7,Fwildfire near Land's End Airport in
OL,8,FCornwall.
OL,10,FCornwall Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fcrews were called to the blaze in the
OL,12,Farea of Crows-An-Wra, St Buryan, at
OL,13,Faround 12:19 on Wednesday 12 August.
OL,15,FThe wildfire has sent a thick plume of
OL,16,Fsmoke into the sky.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
