OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786744247
OL,3,CFirefighters tackling large wildfire
OL,4,Cnear airport
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Cornwall Fire and
OL,7,FRescue Service said: "On arrival, fire
OL,8,Fcrews requested further assistance and
OL,9,Fin total 4 appliances are currently in
OL,10,Fattendance/on their way to this
OL,11,Fincident."
OL,13,FFlights at Land's End Airport have
OL,14,Fbeen suspended, according to the
OL,15,Ftraffic monitoring service Inrix.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for Land's End Airport
OL,18,Fsaid: "We are aware of a fire in the
OL,19,Fvicinity of Land's End Airport, which
OL,20,Fis currently being managed by the
OL,21,Femergency services.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786744247
OL,3,CFirefighters tackling large wildfire
OL,4,Cnear airport
OL,6,F"As a precaution in line with the
OL,7,Fguidance we have received from the
OL,8,Femergency services, Land's End Airport
OL,9,Fis being temporarily closed and
OL,10,Fpassengers and employees are being
OL,11,Fsafely moved away from the airport
OL,12,Fwhile the situation is monitored.
OL,14,F"We will do all we can to maintain our
OL,15,Fservices safely and will provide
OL,16,Ffurther updates as the situation
OL,17,Fdevelops."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
