OL,3,CFirefighters tackling large wildfire
OL,4,Cnear airport
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FPeople across Devon and Cornwall are
OL,12,Fbeing urged to do all they can to
OL,13,Fprevent fires on open land, after
OL,14,Fseveral fires in the last 24 hours.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday 11 August, firefighters in
OL,17,FDevon were called to attend a large
OL,18,Fwildfire in Mincinglake Valley Park,
OL,19,Fin Exeter, that forced some residents
OL,20,Fto leave their homes.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
