OL,3,CFirefighters tackling large wildfire
OL,4,Cnear airport
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Devon and Somerset
OL,7,FFire and Rescue Service said: "The
OL,8,Ffire has affected an area of about 50
OL,9,Facres and we had 20 fire engines as
OL,10,Fwell as a number of specialist
OL,11,Fvehicles at its peak."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
